# 4-bit Up Counter

## Goal

Learn how to implement an 4-bit synchronous up counter in Verilog and understand how sequential logic can update its own state over time.

## Concepts Learned

- counter
- sequential logic
- clock
- reset
- enable
- always block
- posedge
- state updates

## Truth Table

| Reset | Enable | Clock        | Next Count      |
|:-----:|:------:|:------------:|:---------------:|
| 1     | X      | Rising Edge  | 0               |
| 0     | 0      | Rising Edge  | Current Count   |
| 0     | 1      | Rising Edge  | Curr. Count + 1 |
| 0     | X      | No Edge      | Current Count   |

